				751,
				3
			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Register VFS, configuration, and lifecycle channel bridges\n\nAdd four new channel event bridge entries to the Tauri main process service for virtual filesystem changes, configuration updates, workspace folder changes, and lifecycle phase transitions. These channels mirror the definitions in Wind's `TauriMainProcessService.ts`, establishing a locked communication contract between the Output runtime and the UI service layer.\n\n- `localFilesystem.fileChange` (sky://vfs/fileChange)\n- `configuration.onDidChangeConfiguration` (sky://configuration/changed)\n- `workspaces.onDidChangeWorkspaceFolders` (sky://workspaces/changed)\n- `lifecycle.onWillShutdown` (sky://lifecycle/willShutdown)\n- `lifecycle.onDidChangePhase` (sky://lifecycle/phaseChanged)\n\nSynchronize the compiled JavaScript bundle and its source map to match the updated TypeScript source.",
			"SHA": "a9277808e1391175a82afed758232d53707e82dd"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-19T02:05:37Z",
